#~ "backup/restore approach above). The REST "
#~ "API method in this page is the "
#~ "one GraphDB's own vendor documents, "
#~ "tests, and supports — prefer it "
#~ "unless there's a specific reason not "
#~ "to."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Un atajo tentador es saltarse todo "
